; LangBarFB: IT abbreviations, lowercase (Hunspell then accepts them in any case).
; Sources:
;  - abbreviations-in-code, https://github.com/abbrcode/abbreviations-in-code,
;    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 Gabor Kiss-Vamosi;
;  - FOSS Community Acronyms, https://github.com/d-edge/foss-acronyms, CC0 1.0;
;  - list compiled for LangBarFB (LGPL-3.0): common terms and keywords and
;    standard names of C, C++, C#, Python, JavaScript, Java, Go, Rust, SQL,
;    Pascal, FreeBASIC, PHP and shell that are not in en_US.dic.
; Left out: words shorter than 3 letters (except with digits), words already in
; en_US.dic, and words that typed in the Russian layout give a Russian word
; (e.g. evt = "уме", exe = "учу", cfg = "сап"), so that they still switch.
; Words of this file are not added to the word start table (autoswitch on the
; third letter).
